WEBVTT

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:15.550
Do not look so forlorn, everyone.

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:20.010
I can hardly pass on in peace if 
I'm worried about the rest of you.

00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:22.710
Your Majesty, please, you must recover!

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:26.290
The people still need your strength!

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:29.050
This is my fate.

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:34.280
My friends, I leave the rest... in your hands.

00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:38.970
Inglis...

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:43.810
Oh, such a sight for sore eyes!

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:46.240
Divine Alistia...

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:51.060
I had hoped to see you one 
last time before the end.

00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:53.160
As did I, Inglis.

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:56.570
Yours was truly a life well-lived.

00:00:56.900 --> 00:01:01.530
I can think of no greater achievement 
than your efforts to serve the people.

00:01:01.530 --> 00:01:05.390
Oh, no... without Your blessing,

00:01:05.390 --> 00:01:11.090
it would have been impossible to found the 
Kingdom of Silvare in a single lifetime.

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:14.450
But it was the forthright 
nature of your heart

00:01:14.450 --> 00:01:17.190
that allowed you to slay so many 
monsters and wicked gods,

00:01:17.190 --> 00:01:19.790
and become known as the Hero-King.

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:24.540
It seems I chose wisely in 
making you my Divine Knight.

00:01:24.540 --> 00:01:30.150
Your words fill an old man 
with much pride, divine one.

00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:38.380
It is for that reason that I am here today, 
to repay you for your extraordinary efforts.

00:01:38.380 --> 00:01:40.080
I am unworthy.

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:42.460
Is there anything you wish for?

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:47.000
If it is within my power, I will make it so.

00:01:47.590 --> 00:01:50.920
Anything, you say?

00:01:51.810 --> 00:01:58.090
Well... if I could, I would 
choose to be reborn.

00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:03.710
I have dedicated my entire life 
to my kingdom and its people.

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:08.240
I have no regrets about that, and yet...

00:02:08.570 --> 00:02:13.770
Had I not become king, and instead spent my 
life dedicated to honing my martial skill...

00:02:14.140 --> 00:02:17.110
What heights could I have reached?

00:02:17.110 --> 00:02:20.810
I find myself wishing to see that outcome.

00:02:21.590 --> 00:02:24.260
Your wish shall be granted.

00:02:29.840 --> 00:02:35.240
I will look forward to our 
reunion in the distant future,

00:02:35.240 --> 00:02:37.160
once you have been reincarnated.

00:02:49.030 --> 00:02:52.450
Up you go! Look how high you are!

00:02:50.910 --> 00:02:53.630
Dear, you mustn't shake her like that!

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:57.860
<b>Serena</b>

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:57.860
<b>Luke</b>

00:02:54.010 --> 00:02:56.430
You'll frighten our little Inglis.

00:02:56.430 --> 00:02:58.250
<i>Inglis?</i>

00:02:58.840 --> 00:03:02.320
<i>It seems I truly have been reborn!</i>

00:03:02.920 --> 00:03:07.150
<i>And with the same name, in spite of everything.</i>

00:03:02.920 --> 00:03:07.150
You're not afraid, are you, 
Inglis? Oh, no, you aren't!

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:12.560
I have to say, Serena, she looks just 
like you. Such a beautiful girl!

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:15.080
<i>G-Girl?</i>

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:18.580
I'm sure she'll be a fine lady someday.

00:03:18.890 --> 00:03:21.120
<i>A... girl?</i>

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:25.960
<i>I'm a girl?!</i>

00:04:56.020 --> 00:05:00.900
<b>Episode 1    Return of the Hero-King, Inglis</b>

00:05:05.720 --> 00:05:09.940
<i>Good grief. I can't even 
swing a sword as a baby.</i>

00:05:11.510 --> 00:05:15.950
<i>But even after reincarnating, 
my divine blessing is intact.</i>

00:05:16.890 --> 00:05:19.960
<i>I can feel the aether within me.</i>

00:05:21.180 --> 00:05:27.130
<i>Aether is the foundation of 
all creation in the world.</i>

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:31.760
<i>Everything that exists 
is composed of aether,</i>

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:36.800
<i>and control over it means exerting 
your will over the world itself.</i>

00:05:36.800 --> 00:05:39.740
<i>It is, in essence, divine power.</i>

00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:45.820
<i>I only had time to master the 
fundamentals of aether in my past life.</i>

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:50.850
<i>And since being reborn, I haven't seen 
anyone else with control over it.</i>

00:05:50.850 --> 00:05:55.350
<i>It's also troubling that I can't 
sense the goddess anymore.</i>

00:05:55.350 --> 00:05:58.680
A magicite beast is attacking! 
Take cover in the castle!

00:05:58.680 --> 00:06:00.040
<i>Magicite beast?</i>

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:03.220
Chris, we need to escape in a—

00:06:05.520 --> 00:06:07.970
Was she... f-floating?!

00:06:08.810 --> 00:06:11.310
I-I must've been seeing things.

00:06:11.310 --> 00:06:12.970
<i>Will this get her to drop it?</i>

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:14.420
It's all right, Inglis.

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:19.000
Your father and the others will chase 
off the magicite beast soon.

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:21.260
<i>"Magicite beast."</i>

00:06:21.260 --> 00:06:23.770
<i>Now, there is a name that 
captures the imagination!</i>

00:06:25.750 --> 00:06:31.410
<i>Here's hoping they're vicious beasts 
that will make satisfying foes!</i>

00:06:37.260 --> 00:06:38.540
Serena!

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:40.370
Irina!

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:42.070
Where are the children?

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:45.800
<b>Irina</b>

00:06:42.070 --> 00:06:44.630
Rafael is looking after Rafinha.

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:46.070
Hurry, inside!

00:06:46.070 --> 00:06:46.880
Yes!

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:51.710
Mother. Auntie. I'm glad
 to see you're all right.

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:51.680
<b>Rafael  Age 8</b>

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:54.530
How has Rafinha been, Rafael?

00:06:54.530 --> 00:06:56.790
She's right here. And behaving very well.

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:58.350
<b>Rafinha  Age 0</b>

00:06:58.360 --> 00:07:01.440
It'll be all right now, Chris.

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:05.220
We can wait here while the knights 
chase off the magicite beast.

00:07:08.170 --> 00:07:10.480
<i>That's a magicite beast?</i>

00:07:11.350 --> 00:07:15.670
<i>Mm. It seems the color of those stones 
varies between each creature.</i>

00:07:16.280 --> 00:07:19.090
<i>Do they contain the power of condensed mana?</i>

00:07:20.880 --> 00:07:23.960
<i>The world seems to have become 
much more dangerous...</i>

00:07:24.230 --> 00:07:26.390
<i>Which works out nicely for me!</i>

00:07:27.160 --> 00:07:29.290
<i>I'm itching to get started!</i>

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:31.290
Come on, settle down.

00:07:31.770 --> 00:07:36.370
You can't blame her. This is the first 
time she's seen a magicite beast, right?

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:38.440
It's only natural that she'd be scared.

00:07:38.440 --> 00:07:42.890
I can only hope that we're rid 
of those monsters someday,

00:07:42.890 --> 00:07:44.390
for the sake of the children...

00:07:45.170 --> 00:07:47.480
<i>You mustn't say such things, Mother!</i>

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:50.040
<i>I'm in need of worthy foes!</i>

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:52.600
<i>That means I need those magicite beasts!</i>

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:56.270
There, there. Don't be afraid, Chris.

00:07:56.860 --> 00:07:58.450
It's so frustrating.

00:07:58.450 --> 00:08:04.160
I've already received my Rune, 
but I can't do more than watch from here.

00:08:04.450 --> 00:08:05.920
<i>Runes.</i>

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:12.060
<i>They are needed to wield Artifacts, the weapons
 that allow combat against magicite beasts,</i>

00:08:12.060 --> 00:08:15.210
<i>and are the mark of all knights.</i>

00:08:15.870 --> 00:08:18.290
<i>Those didn't exist in my past life, either.</i>

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:19.520
Rafael...

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:22.060
Your Rune is of a special caliber.

00:08:22.490 --> 00:08:28.240
The kind only given to the chosen few 
who will represent the hope of all people.

00:08:28.630 --> 00:08:31.940
You must not fall in a place like this.

00:08:32.380 --> 00:08:33.780
Do you understand?

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:35.780
Yes, Mother.

00:08:36.010 --> 00:08:39.090
Even if you have to abandon 
everyone else here,

00:08:39.090 --> 00:08:41.160
you must survive, no matter what.

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:42.720
B-But that's...

00:08:45.550 --> 00:08:46.620
Sister!

00:08:48.220 --> 00:08:49.540
Mother!

00:08:54.310 --> 00:08:55.470
No!

00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:08.800
Rafael!

00:09:11.180 --> 00:09:12.750
Auntie?!

00:09:12.750 --> 00:09:14.750
Take the babies and run!

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:18.210
But that sword won't be of any use!

00:09:18.770 --> 00:09:20.900
Just get the two of them to safety!

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:27.480
Auntie!

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:30.470
<i>Mm. Her swordplay is by no means lacking.</i>

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:33.830
<i>But this magicite beast is more 
agile than one might think.</i>

00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:38.180
What are you doing?! Hurry and go!

00:09:42.230 --> 00:09:45.970
Rani, Chris, I'm sorry. 
Just wait here for a moment!

00:09:47.350 --> 00:09:48.620
I'll help you!

00:09:48.620 --> 00:09:50.810
No! You need to run!

00:09:51.300 --> 00:09:57.280
If I can't protect the people I care about, 
how can I help anyone else?!

00:09:57.500 --> 00:09:59.450
<i>Well said, boy!</i>

00:10:00.420 --> 00:10:04.150
<i>You do not become a hero at 
someone else's direction...</i>

00:10:04.880 --> 00:10:10.550
<i>but through the fruit of your 
own choices, your own actions!</i>

00:10:16.270 --> 00:10:18.430
Auntie...

00:10:25.840 --> 00:10:29.100
<i>He's too gallant a lad to let 
die in a place like this.</i>

00:10:29.100 --> 00:10:32.810
<i>I'm living this new life for my own sake.</i>

00:10:33.370 --> 00:10:36.070
<i>And that means I have 
no interest in heroism.</i>

00:10:36.510 --> 00:10:37.480
<i>Yet...</i>

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:42.360
<i>I am not disinclined to lend my aid 
to those with heroic potential!</i>

00:10:48.350 --> 00:10:51.040
<i>Aether Strike!</i>

00:11:00.910 --> 00:11:05.220
<i>A fair showing, I'd say, for a baby.</i>

00:11:06.670 --> 00:11:08.520
C-C-Chris?

00:11:10.070 --> 00:11:12.490
Wh-What just happened?

00:11:12.490 --> 00:11:14.220
<i>W-Was he awake?!</i>

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:16.930
I'm so glad...

00:11:17.790 --> 00:11:22.670
<i>You'd do well to think you caught a 
fleeting glimpse of a dream, boy.</i>

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:26.780
<i>Things... should be fine... now...</i>

00:11:27.630 --> 00:11:33.120
<i>A baby's stamina... was not 
meant... for battle...</i>

00:11:28.140 --> 00:11:31.980
Ma'am! Master Rafael! Are you all right?!

00:11:33.120 --> 00:11:34.020
<i>Oof...</i>

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:37.520
I'm just glad no one's hurt.

00:11:37.520 --> 00:11:39.180
All thanks to Rafael.

00:11:39.180 --> 00:11:41.560
And the town wasn't too badly damaged.

00:11:41.830 --> 00:11:45.380
No, but we need to re-examine 
the town's security.

00:11:45.820 --> 00:11:48.620
If the beast had been a Prismer...

00:11:48.620 --> 00:11:51.480
It takes only one of those creatures 
to lay waste to a nation.

00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:54.170
<i>Well, isn't that interesting?</i>

00:11:54.950 --> 00:11:56.920
<i>These "Prismer" beasts...</i>

00:11:57.490 --> 00:12:00.590
<i>will make for fine prey.</i>

00:12:01.050 --> 00:12:03.230
<i>Something to look forward to.</i>

00:12:09.310 --> 00:12:13.110
<i>My rebirth seems to have come with quite 
the darling change in appearance!</i>

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:15.750
<b>Inglis  Age 5</b>

00:12:13.110 --> 00:12:16.000
<i>In time, I'm likely to become
 an unparalleled beauty!</i>

00:12:16.270 --> 00:12:19.210
<i>What I would have done for 
a granddaughter like this!</i>

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:24.170
Oh, my! Our Chris really does love 
looking in the mirror, doesn't she?

00:12:24.170 --> 00:12:29.740
I don't know what it is. She's so 
clever and well-behaved otherwise.

00:12:29.740 --> 00:12:31.020
Chris!

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:32.980
<b>Rafinha  Age 5</b>

00:12:31.630 --> 00:12:32.660
Rani!

00:12:33.200 --> 00:12:36.430
Where's the harm? She <i>is</i> adorable.

00:12:36.430 --> 00:12:38.330
Enough to even dazzle herself, right?

00:12:38.560 --> 00:12:42.020
Auntie, I apologize for 
that unseemly display.

00:12:42.340 --> 00:12:46.250
And so well-spoken, too!

00:12:46.250 --> 00:12:49.220
It's hard to believe she's 
only five, like Rani.

00:12:49.560 --> 00:12:53.480
What kind of lessons made 
her turn out like this?

00:12:53.480 --> 00:12:55.440
We didn't do anything, really.

00:12:55.440 --> 00:12:57.370
I, uh, read about it in a book.

00:12:57.630 --> 00:13:00.540
Chris! Let's work hard at practice today.

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:01.640
Right!

00:13:10.610 --> 00:13:12.350
Oh, no!

00:13:13.340 --> 00:13:15.290
Are you all right, Rani?

00:13:16.540 --> 00:13:18.260
Here, stand up.

00:13:19.430 --> 00:13:20.990
Chris...

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:23.200
You need to brace your hips.

00:13:23.200 --> 00:13:25.700
Try to do it like everyone else.

00:13:26.050 --> 00:13:28.560
Come now, Master Rafael! 
No need to hold back!

00:13:28.930 --> 00:13:31.100
Right. If you please!

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:34.120
<b>Rafael  Age 13</b>

00:13:31.100 --> 00:13:34.150
<i>The eldest son of the local lord, 
the Duke of Bilford.</i>

00:13:34.520 --> 00:13:36.340
You can do it, Brother!

00:13:34.520 --> 00:13:37.380
<i>Dignified, serious, and dedicated.</i>

00:13:37.860 --> 00:13:40.540
<i>Everyone expects great things 
from him as the next lord.</i>

00:13:41.290 --> 00:13:43.660
<i>And with exceptional martial talents.</i>

00:13:41.560 --> 00:13:44.340
Enough! Master Rafael wins.

00:13:44.650 --> 00:13:46.080
Well done.

00:13:46.080 --> 00:13:47.620
Thank you!

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:49.960
He's so amazing!

00:13:49.330 --> 00:13:51.930
<i>I'd say that the only 
person among these knights</i>

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:54.940
<i>who can stand against him is 
my father, their captain.</i>

00:13:55.510 --> 00:13:58.280
<i>I'd love to spar with him someday!</i>

00:13:58.490 --> 00:14:00.720
Greetings, Sir Luke!

00:14:00.720 --> 00:14:02.850
Pardon the intrusion.

00:14:02.850 --> 00:14:04.810
Mr. Rambach!

00:14:05.170 --> 00:14:06.920
It's a pleasure to have you joining us.

00:14:07.290 --> 00:14:11.870
Everyone, meet the Rambach Company, 
who have joined us for a mock duel.

00:14:12.150 --> 00:14:13.880
The Rambach Company?

00:14:13.880 --> 00:14:18.780
Well, I heard that people who trade get 
attacked by magicite beasts a lot!

00:14:18.780 --> 00:14:20.400
How lucky for them!

00:14:20.850 --> 00:14:22.560
Er, never mind.

00:14:22.910 --> 00:14:26.650
And that's why they train with the 
knights sometimes to get stronger!

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:28.320
My brother told me.

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:32.640
This is my son, Rahl.

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:35.000
My name is Rahl.

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:36.880
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:14:36.880 --> 00:14:38.270
Likewise, of course.

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:40.890
You seem to be the same 
age as Master Rafael.

00:14:41.850 --> 00:14:43.910
I'm Rafael Bilford.

00:14:43.910 --> 00:14:45.440
It's a pleasure to have you joining us.

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:47.640
L-Likewise...

00:14:54.900 --> 00:14:57.720
That's enough! Rahl wins.

00:14:57.720 --> 00:15:01.670
Wow! He beat ten people by himself!

00:15:02.010 --> 00:15:04.740
The knights were dominating at first.

00:15:05.080 --> 00:15:07.450
The flow changed completely 
once he picked up a sword.

00:15:08.250 --> 00:15:12.230
Are you knights out of shape or something?

00:15:12.230 --> 00:15:13.730
It would make sense,

00:15:13.730 --> 00:15:16.190
given how few magicite beast 
attacks there have been lately.

00:15:16.190 --> 00:15:18.770
He sure got snooty fast, huh?

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:20.650
<i>It was an act all along.</i>

00:15:20.650 --> 00:15:26.100
While we've been having to contest with 
those creatures constantly during our travels.

00:15:26.540 --> 00:15:30.330
That boy suddenly seems a lot stronger.

00:15:30.330 --> 00:15:33.100
It's hard to find your footing against him.

00:15:33.100 --> 00:15:39.060
It was the same for me. He must be 
really skilled at gauging striking range.

00:15:39.060 --> 00:15:41.040
<i>Are they serious?</i>

00:15:41.340 --> 00:15:44.240
<i>It's obvious he's using some kind of magic.</i>

00:15:44.640 --> 00:15:48.520
<i>The use of mana, a weakened 
distillation of aether,</i>

00:15:48.520 --> 00:15:53.510
<i>as fuel to cause supernatural phenomena:</i>

00:15:53.510 --> 00:15:55.960
<i>That is magic.</i>

00:15:56.480 --> 00:15:59.800
<i>He's restricting the movement of 
anyone who makes eye contact...</i>

00:15:59.800 --> 00:16:01.410
<i>A kind of binding.</i>

00:16:02.070 --> 00:16:04.490
<i>And a weak kind at that.</i>

00:16:04.490 --> 00:16:07.830
<i>All it does is hinder the 
opponent's movements slightly.</i>

00:16:08.630 --> 00:16:11.140
<i>Yet no one has been able to notice it.</i>

00:16:11.140 --> 00:16:18.230
<i>It seems the people of this time have truly 
lost all knowledge and concept of magic.</i>

00:16:24.690 --> 00:16:25.720
Rani!

00:16:29.680 --> 00:16:30.730
Chris!

00:16:31.810 --> 00:16:33.080
Thank you.

00:16:33.080 --> 00:16:34.860
Well, this is a shame.

00:16:34.860 --> 00:16:38.340
I came here hoping to 
learn from you knights...

00:16:38.610 --> 00:16:42.060
But now it's like I'm teaching <i>you</i> a lesson!

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:45.650
Come now, Rahl! Let's not be rude.

00:16:47.630 --> 00:16:50.950
I'll face you next, Rahl.

00:16:51.210 --> 00:16:56.130
It's an honor to face a future holy knight.

00:16:56.130 --> 00:16:59.270
Let's have a fair contest, shall we?

00:16:59.530 --> 00:17:01.460
<i>Oh, he's being absolutely brazen.</i>

00:17:01.870 --> 00:17:03.760
Excuse me, Cousin Raf?

00:17:04.090 --> 00:17:05.900
What is it, Chris?

00:17:05.900 --> 00:17:09.570
I think you should try to avoid 
looking at him as much as possible.

00:17:09.570 --> 00:17:10.950
What do you mean?

00:17:11.250 --> 00:17:15.500
Something strange is going on. 
Everyone is moving sluggishly.

00:17:15.500 --> 00:17:20.160
And Rahl always positions himself 
directly in front of his opponent.

00:17:21.010 --> 00:17:23.130
It makes me wonder if 
something's going on.

00:17:24.050 --> 00:17:26.420
Fight without looking at him, eh?

00:17:26.920 --> 00:17:30.270
<i>I doubt he'd understand if I told 
him that this fight involves magic.</i>

00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:32.310
<i>Better to just hint at it.</i>

00:17:33.180 --> 00:17:35.680
Understood, Chris. And thank you.

00:17:36.940 --> 00:17:40.460
C-Chris, my brother can win, can't he?

00:17:40.460 --> 00:17:41.730
It'll be all right!

00:17:41.730 --> 00:17:45.910
And you can cheer him on 
to encourage him, Rani.

00:17:46.740 --> 00:17:47.780
Yeah!

00:17:47.780 --> 00:17:50.440
You can do it, Brother!

00:17:50.440 --> 00:17:51.050
Begin!

00:18:01.450 --> 00:18:02.560
He's pushing him!

00:18:02.560 --> 00:18:04.180
Attaboy, Master Rafael!

00:18:04.440 --> 00:18:06.010
Brother!

00:18:06.310 --> 00:18:07.850
<i>I can do this!</i>

00:18:08.460 --> 00:18:09.410
Damn it!

00:18:09.410 --> 00:18:10.700
Right there, Master Rafael!

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:12.240
Don't let him recover!

00:18:13.050 --> 00:18:13.770
Look out!

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:19.440
I've got you!

00:18:21.260 --> 00:18:22.420
That's enough!

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:25.200
Rahl wins.

00:18:25.980 --> 00:18:28.570
Magnificent, Rahl, my boy!

00:18:28.990 --> 00:18:33.660
How fitting of a future holy knight, 
and the heir to this land...

00:18:33.990 --> 00:18:37.180
He's clearly on another level 
compared to the other knights.

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:42.510
He lost...

00:18:44.270 --> 00:18:45.550
It's okay.

00:18:47.430 --> 00:18:49.850
I'll avenge him.

00:18:50.730 --> 00:18:53.430
Charging in without looking 
at the opponent...

00:18:53.430 --> 00:18:58.780
Can you all accept a holy knight 
like this leading you someday?

00:18:59.220 --> 00:19:01.590
It was a shameful display.

00:19:01.590 --> 00:19:02.830
Well done!

00:19:05.590 --> 00:19:09.290
Would you be willing to teach 
me a bit before you go?

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:11.830
Oh, come off it.

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:15.240
How am I supposed to fight 
a little girl like this?

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:18.420
Go and find some dolls to play with.

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:23.920
Would you rather I explain 
what you've been doing?

00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:27.650
Wh-What are you insinuating?

00:19:27.650 --> 00:19:30.410
I believe you know exactly what.

00:19:30.410 --> 00:19:31.660
So, what do you say?

00:19:32.430 --> 00:19:35.720
Fine, then! Just don't 
cry after you get hurt!

00:19:36.140 --> 00:19:37.750
Likewise.

00:19:38.560 --> 00:19:40.860
Inglis, this is crazy!

00:19:40.860 --> 00:19:43.040
He's right, Chris! Don't do it.

00:19:43.030 --> 00:19:50.000
<b>Chris's Intentions</b>

00:19:43.030 --> 00:19:50.000
<b>Teach Rahl a lesson</b>

00:19:43.030 --> 00:19:50.000
<b>Make Rani stop crying</b>

00:19:43.030 --> 00:19:50.000
<b>WANNA FIGHT</b>

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:47.140
No! Young as I am, 
I'm my father's daughter!

00:19:47.140 --> 00:19:49.990
I must uphold the honor of his knights!

00:19:49.990 --> 00:19:52.850
As admirable as that is...

00:19:52.850 --> 00:19:58.060
If you don't let me, I'm going to tell 
Mother about that new vase you bought.

00:19:59.150 --> 00:20:02.290
Understood! Fight hard, Inglis!

00:20:02.540 --> 00:20:04.680
<i>I'm glad we could come to an understanding.</i>

00:20:04.920 --> 00:20:05.900
Begin!

00:20:06.390 --> 00:20:08.840
Good luck, Chris!

00:20:13.140 --> 00:20:18.960
<i>I can dispel this paltry magic with 
the aether that wreathes my body!</i>

00:20:22.040 --> 00:20:25.490
<i>I'd win with ease by using aether.</i>

00:20:25.490 --> 00:20:27.780
<i>But what fun would that be?</i>

00:20:28.770 --> 00:20:32.480
<i>This will be a pure contest, 
measured solely in skill with swords!</i>

00:20:36.020 --> 00:20:38.690
<i>I managed something similar in 
my past life, at a young age...</i>

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:40.280
<i>And now?</i>

00:20:42.730 --> 00:20:46.850
<i>I have the perfect opportunity to measure 
my current abilities in actual combat!</i>

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:00.190
Damn it!

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:02.900
What <i>are</i> you?!

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:13.240
It seems my daughter is a child prodigy!

00:21:18.890 --> 00:21:20.380
Incredible...

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:22.050
You're incredible, Chris!

00:21:22.050 --> 00:21:23.760
Chris!

00:21:35.790 --> 00:21:38.090
I... I give.

00:21:42.050 --> 00:21:43.960
Thank you for the bout.

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:50.020
You were amazing, Chris!

00:21:50.020 --> 00:21:51.740
Thank you, Rani!

00:21:59.120 --> 00:22:01.270
<i>Not a bad fight at all.</i>

00:22:01.990 --> 00:22:05.340
<i>I'd say this merits a passing 
score for where I am now.</i>

00:22:05.340 --> 00:22:06.390
<i>But I've got further to go.</i>

00:22:07.140 --> 00:22:09.820
<i>I need to aim even higher!</i>

00:22:10.350 --> 00:22:12.870
<i>That's the reason why I was reborn!</i>

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:50.020
m 522 13 l 613 13 611 178 566 190 524 168

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:50.020
You think
 we can
 play 
house 
with this?

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:50.020
